---
import VoiceCounterCard from "~/components/home/VoiceCounterCard.astro";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Country counter band demo" noIndex>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
		<p class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 uppercase">demo</p>
		<h1 class="font-display text-h1 tracking-display mt-2">Country counter band</h1>
		<p class="text-body text-ink-2 mt-4 max-w-prose">
			The cyan brand moment between the home hero and the starting eleven (relocated out of the hero
			in DEV-124 — the hero's right column is now the campaign film). The prototype's Process Cyan
			(#00AEEF) fails AA against white at every text size; the fill is
			<code>bg-fairness</code> (#007AB1) instead — the existing AA-cleared cyan-family token already documented
			in
			<code>INTENTIONAL_DIVERGENCES</code>. Static treatment: the band has no live-pulse row — the
			country count grows in steps, not ticks, so a "live" dot would read as stalled most of the
			time.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-12">
			<article aria-labelledby="demo-default">
				<h2
					id="demo-default"
					class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 mb-4 uppercase"
				>
					Default — count 247
				</h2>
				<VoiceCounterCard count={247} />
			</article>

			<article aria-labelledby="demo-loading">
				<h2
					id="demo-loading"
					class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 mb-4 uppercase"
				>
					Loading — skeleton block (deviates from prototype)
				</h2>
				<VoiceCounterCard count={247} loading />
			</article>

			<article aria-labelledby="demo-error">
				<h2
					id="demo-error"
					class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 mb-4 uppercase"
				>
					Error fallback — paper / ink, defensive only
				</h2>
				<VoiceCounterCard count={247} error />
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
